 "acquisition": 1,
 "acquisition_voice": "",
 "character_status_id": 1060001503,
 "desc": "An officer in the Delaz Fleet. He is an ace pilot of the\nZeon forces who was feared as the \"Nightmare of Solomon\"\nduring the One Year War.\nTalented enough to get into the modern history books, he is\nbest known for attacking the Federation Forces' Torrington\nbase and stealing the Gundam GP02.\nPopular among subordinates and comrades, his proud spirit\nand nobility give him the bearing and personality of a\nwarrior. The same traits cause him to dislike fellow Delaz\nFleet officer Cima Garahau, who has a dark side.\nHe is also an idealist who has a naive infatuation with the\nDelaz Fleet leader Aiguille Delaz.\nDuring the Delaz Conflict, he puts his life on the line to\nrealize the dream that Operation Stardust represents.",
